<title>THAILAND: Pacific Asset shows third quarter profit.</title>
<headline>Pacific Asset shows third quarter profit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated audited financial results for the first nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)    profit   0.09     vs loss	0.67</p>
<p>    Net	     profit  15.15     vs loss    116.90</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss	0.60     vs  loss     1.26</p>
<p>    Net	    loss    106.71     vs  loss   220.42</p>
<p>NOTE: Pacific Asset Plc is a hotel operator. Figures include subsidiaries' results.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
